  "details": "Currently as we all know, when you're done downloading a world you get sent into a separate loading screen for initializing it.\nAll I ask is that a simple progress bar, similar to that of the previous downloading screen, can be implemented to this initializing page so that we can track the loading progress.\nNewer worlds are getting bigger and bigger, and some are starting to take a little while to load into, and because of the current lack of feedback to the user in that screen, I've encountered repeatedly some people grow impatient and assume that the game must have frozen, and promptly restart their game, report the world, and carry on.\nIf a progress bar was implemented, these users will better recognize that it's still simply processing the content and that they need to wait rather than quit. This feature may also be beneficial to those encountering bugs involving loading to be able to identify when things go wrong.\nI hope this isn't too much to ask for and can be considered! :D",
